cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FAIR-Checker in your work, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "FAIR-Checker"
abstract: >-
  FAIR-Checker is a tool aimed at assessing FAIR principles and empowering
  data providers to enhance the quality of their digital resources. It extracts
  embedded metadata (RDFa, JSON-LD, microdata), retrieves metadata through HTTP
  content negotiation and FAIR Signposting, evaluates FAIR metrics, and provides
  recommendations and inspection tools.
